7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]plus_one_post_close_reopen_race.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/plus_one_post_close_reopen_race.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-ix[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-ix/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Observation-window freshness rule in the bead core[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: carry each +1 reporter's observation-window start on the evidence [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire, and reopen a closed task only when that window starts after the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]close, in both the mutation path and the event reducer.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Supplying and overriding the observation window from Python[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: resolve the reporter's observation-window start from its own agent [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]metadata, thread it through the mutation facade, add the explicit [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]post-close override flag, and report a withheld reopen accurately.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Making withheld corroboration visible[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]surfaces[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]surfaces: render post-close corroboration on the closed bead across the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CLI, ACE, generated pages, and gate previews, and teach the task-filing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]skill when the override applies.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end race regression and store audit[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after surfaces[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify: reproduce the original race end to end as a regression exercise,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]audit the live store for beads reopened by this race, and reconcile the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documented contract.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ix","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-ix.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-25581471e210fca5ad0dcdab44041d67","started_at":"2026-08-10T14:51:56.298423+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"5454224581a591c88f2a3254f60724b9d6ee84103b374f2852f6afa16071ef7f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ix.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"847bc15d262a52596ab67ba30427112ea189cc34522d54f0b0fbac9e0e101ed4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ix.land/meta.json","size_bytes":613},"prompt":{"digest":"d934069c6f1999c289b19b946ac0ce5e22d57bb4ad4352ae3a339f0bac9d1639","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ix.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":226},"state":{"digest":"29cabb296efe36d9e4761dc337d29f8dbfb90ca43cc435a134a338191bbba243","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ix.land/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-ix.land","local_name":"sase-ix.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-ix","agent_clan_generation":"20260810105139","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-ix","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ix","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","patch_na